-- Maps between metric spaces and metric spaces built from others:
-- ε–δ continuity against continuity of the metric topologies, Lipschitz
-- maps, isometries, and uniform continuity, completeness, and the real
-- line, discrete, subspace, and product metrics as values
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
